+/// HybridGt: whether the title's bytes put in under shader writes go to a
+/// copy in the card's memory through one masked merge on the card per send
+/// (`VICTORY_GPU_MERGE=1`, with [`relay`] and the merge's pipeline made):
+/// the title's CPU writes 85,000-102,000 runs a frame of 2-3 bytes each
