+/// HybridGt: the masked merge's state for one copy in the card's memory.
+///
+/// `pending`: what the next send takes, as (dword offset, byte mask) for the
+/// shader, which takes each masked byte from the CPU's side. `runs`: every
+/// merged byte run not yet known landed, by first offset, with its end and
+/// the number of the send that took it (`u64::MAX` while pending). The
